# Put your solana-keygen keypairs here (git-ignored):
#   merchant.json   ← shopping agent's receiving wallet
#   buyer.json      ← buyer agent's wallet (holds devnet USDC + SOL for fees)
#
# These are id.json files (JSON array of 64 bytes), e.g. from:
#   solana-keygen new --no-bip39-passphrase -o wallets/buyer.json
